                <TextBlock Text="◈" Foreground="{DynamicResource AmberBrush}" FontSize="17" Margin="0,0,12,0" />
                <TextBlock Text="Safe guidance: future secrets belong in Windows-protected local-service storage, never in this renderer, logs, chat, command arguments, source control, or fixtures. Every integration starts with identity/scope tests and a read-only canary."
